name 'ai-generated-design-postassessment-q1_2025'

question 'A new grocery delivery app has a sleek design, but many users give it low ratings because it\'s difficult to find the "Add to Cart" button and checkout process. What would most improve the app\'s user experience?'

wrong 'Adding more colors and animations to make the app visually exciting.'
wrong 'Removing the checkout process entirely to speed up ordering.'
wrong 'Hiding extra options in more menus to make the interface simpler.'
right 'Making the "Add to Cart" button larger and easier to find on every product page.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

